    "KR Sridhar is founder, chairman and CEO of fuel cell energy systems manufacturer Bloom Energy.",
    "He launched the company in 2001 and took it public on the New York Stock Exchange in 2018.",
    "Sridhar owns nearly 2% of the $2 billion (2025 revenue) firm.",
    "Sridhar led a team at NASA developing oxygen-generation technology before founding Bloom Energy.",
    "Born in India, Sridhar earned his master's in nuclear engineering and PhD in mechanical engineering from the University of Illinois, Urbana-Champaign."
